{
  "note": [
    "A CENSUS OF THE LIVE CHAIN \u2014 the independent oracle for the factory-door cut.",
    "",
    "Not a list written here and not a restatement of the script: Base Sepolia's own answer to",
    "'which selectors are mounted in the diamond today', read through the loupe with",
    "  cast call $DIAMOND_ADDRESS \"facets()((address,bytes4[])[])\"",
    "The composition of the cut (script/UpgradeFactoryInternalDeploy.s.sol) is held",
    "against THIS, never against itself.",
    "",
    "WHY IT MATTERS FOR THIS ONE. The cut is a pure Replace of all twenty-three",
    "FactoryFacet selectors: `deployAgreement` keeps its signature (0x7ba33dab) and",
    "only its guard changed, so nothing is added and nothing removed. `Replace`",
    "reverts 'Diamond: selector not found' on a selector that is NOT mounted, so the",
    "claim that has to be proved before signing is 'all twenty-three are mounted",
    "today, all on one facet, and that facet holds nothing else'. Two claims, and",
    "neither may be taken from the script:",
    "",
    "  * every selector the rebuilt FactoryFacet exposes is mounted today -> it",
    "    belongs in Replace and the Add group is empty;",
    "  * every selector mounted on the factory facet today is still exposed by the",
    "    rebuilt facet -> nothing is left pointing at code that no longer implements",
    "    it.",
    "",
    "The whole routed list is here as well, not only the factory's twenty-three: the",
    "'mounted nowhere' half of the question is about the diamond, not about one",
    "facet, and a stand that only had one facet's list could not ask it.",
    "",
    "HOW TO RE-READ IT (no transaction, and none of these writes anything):",
    "  cast call $DIAMOND_ADDRESS \"facets()((address,bytes4[])[])\" --rpc-url $BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL",
    "  cast call $DIAMOND_ADDRESS \"getFeeBps()(uint256)\" --rpc-url $BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL",
    "  cast call $DIAMOND_ADDRESS \"getAgreementDeployer()(address)\" --rpc-url $BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL"
  ],
